WEBVTT

00:00:58.708 --> 00:01:02.393
She got promoted
five times over five years,

00:01:02.417 --> 00:01:04.875
but one day, she learned
something upsetting.

00:01:06.167 --> 00:01:10.268
GS: Somebody told me
that I was the lowest-paid employee

00:01:10.292 --> 00:01:12.226
in my department of 250 people,

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:15.851
even though I was
the highest-rated performer

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.518
within my band levels,

00:01:17.542 --> 00:01:20.476
and I was promoted
consistently every year,

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:23.434
but just never asked
for a salary increase.

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:26.309
AG: How many years,
looking back, were you underpaid?

00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:28.143
GS: It was six years.

00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:29.583
Six freaking years.